The mobile surface (src/mobile, pairing, gate, routes, mobile-api) was
extracted from the dsh-remote-web-ui `local/mobile-fixes` branch (M1,
behavior-identical) and has since been modified and extended independently:
windowed streaming, inline-markdown preview, image upload, workspace
browsing, PWA, and the desktop pairing panel.

This product also depends on the dsh platform packages
(@deepseek-ai/dsh-*, Apache-2.0, https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness).

The phone UI bundle shipped in assets/mobile.bundle.js is built from source
vendored under mobile-src/ (see mobile-src/UPSTREAM.md), forked from
dsh-palm v1.6.0 (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/Eternalloveone/dsh-palm).
This repository does not track upstream feature work; the vendored source is
maintained here. Local changes carried in that fork:
  · Settings → 外观 gains a native 「发送模式」 row that reads/writes the host
    plugin's window.__dmSendMode (send mode is stored on the host, not locally);
  · the usage card label reads 「充值余额」 (was 「账户余额」).
Everything else in mobile-src/src is upstream v1.6.0 as published.

